  "whyThisWorks": "WHY THIS WORKS",
  "safePlaceDefault": "Think of a place — real or imagined — where you feel completely safe. It might be a room, a landscape, a memory. It belongs only to you.",
  "safePrompt1": "Settle in. There is nowhere you need to be right now.\n\nLet your breathing slow naturally.",
  "safePrompt2": "Bring your safe place to mind. Allow yourself to arrive there.",
  "safePrompt3": "Notice what you can see. The colours, the light, the shapes around you.",
  "safePrompt4": "What sounds are here? Gentle, familiar sounds that belong to this place.",
  "safePrompt5": "Feel the temperature. The air on your skin. The ground beneath you.",
  "safePrompt6": "You are safe here. Nothing can reach you in this place.",
  "safePrompt7": "Stay as long as you need. This place is always available to you.\n\nYou can return here any time you close your eyes.",
