  "attuneMaskWaiting": "A local recording can be added later. This slider stays quiet until then.",
  "attuneMaskMusicNote": "Using your own music? Choose ambient tracks or classical music around 60 BPM. Fast or aggressive music will clash with the entrainment frequencies and may cause anxiety.",
  "attuneMaskNext": "Next track",
  "attuneMaskTrackSpring": "Vivaldi, Spring",
